fail[3]: Typing "bc" between "a" and "d" gives "abcd", and moving right goes to the end.
fail[4]: Only "hel" is to the left of the cursor, so only 3 characters are deleted, and the cursor is then before "lo".
fail[5]: 11 characters are left of the cursor, and only the last 10 come back.
fail[6]: After 1999 moves left, the cursor has the first "abcdefghij" on its left, and after the last move it's at the start. Rebuilding the whole text for every call takes too long here.
error[TimeoutError]: Rebuilding the whole text for each call takes too long. Keep the characters left of the cursor and those right of it in two lists, so each call only moves the few characters it touches.
edges:
